  "details": "HelpURL is a useful class attribute for allowing the end user to click the little question mark icon (?) on a component's header, which results in the web page assigned to that attribute to be opened.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/HelpURLAttribute.html\n\nAs far as I'm aware, none of the components in the VRChat SDK are utilizing this attribute, resulting in creators having to open the web page for the documentation manually when they want to learn more about a certain component.\n\nE.g. VRCStation component would have the following attribute:\n\n```\n\nnamespace VRC.SDK3.Components\n\n{\n\n    [HelpURL(\"https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/components/vrc_station\")]\n\n    public class VRCStation : VRC.SDKBase.VRCStation { }\n\n}\n\n```\n\nwhich points to the documentation of the VRCStation on the official Creators website.",
